    "shortlink": "https://www.w3.org/TR/webaudio-1.1/",
    "description": "<p>This specification describes a high-level Web API for processing and synthesizing audio in web applications. The primary paradigm is of an audio routing graph, where a number of AudioNode objects are connected together to define the overall audio rendering. The actual processing will primarily take place in the underlying implementation (typically optimized Assembly / C / C++ code), but direct script processing and synthesis is also supported.</p>",
    "title": "Web Audio API 1.1",
    "shortname": "webaudio-1.1",
    "editor-draft": "https://webaudio.github.io/web-audio-api/",
